#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.calligra.braindump.metainfo.xml:11
msgid "Braindump"
msgstr "Braindump"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.calligra.braindump.metainfo.xml:12
msgid "Notes and ideas gathering"
msgstr "Prikupljanje bilješki i ideja"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.braindump.metainfo.xml:14
msgid "Braindump is a tool to dump and organize the content of your brain (ideas, drawings, images, texts…) to your computer. It works by allowing to create and edit whiteboards, which are infinite canvas on which you can add texts, images, charts, drawings, etc."
msgstr "Braindump je alat za bilježenje i organiziranje sadržaja vašeg uma (ideja, crteža, slika, tekstova…) na računalu. Omogućuje stvaranje i uređivanje ploča za crtanje, beskonačnih platna na koja možete dodavati tekstove, slike, grafikone, crteže itd."

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.calligra.braindump.metainfo.xml:24
msgid "Main window of Braindump showing a music partition and many other shapes"
msgstr "Glavni prozor Braindumpa s prikazom glazbene partiture i mnogih drugih oblika"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.braindump.metainfo.xml:66
msgid "This release add flatpak support to the Calligra Office suite."
msgstr "Ovo izdanje dodaje podršku za Flatpak uredskom paketu Calligra."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.braindump.metainfo.xml:72
msgid "The most significant changes are that Calligra has been fully transitioned to Qt6 and KF6, along with a major overhaul of its user interface."
msgstr "Najznačajnije su promjene potpuni prijelaz Calligre na Qt 6 i KF 6 te temeljita obnova korisničkog sučelja."
